Package: nautilus
Version: @DEB_NAUTILUS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Applications
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/Nautilus/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, libgnome-autoar-0-0, libportal1, libportal-gtk4-1, libtracker-sparql-3.0-0, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dbus
Description: GNOME Files, the GTK4 file manager
 Nautilus (GNOME Files) is the GTK4/libadwaita file manager. Built without the
 stock extensions (gexiv2/gstreamer), cloudproviders, and PackageKit to keep the
 dependency tree minimal. Runs as a plain X11 client under any window manager.
